                <pb facs="1454" n="1340" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg1340"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the
                        Secretary of Labor</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Perkins</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-09-16">September 16,
                        1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the Secretary of Labor</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The Prime Minister seemed wholly favorable to a calling of the meeting by the
                        I.L.O. The place suggested was Montreal. I
                    see no reason, therefore, why you should not go ahead with it.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
